          "transcript": "Good morning, City Sports Complex. How can I help you today? Hello, I'd like to ask about signing up for a family membership. Certainly. Could I take your name first please? Yes, it's Sarah Jenkins. That's J-E-N-K-I-N-S. And what is your contact telephone number? It is 07945 882190. Thank you. And which membership tier are you interested in? We offer Standard, Premium, and Gold. We would like the Premium package, which includes the swimming pool and gym access. Excellent. The annual fee for the Premium package is four hundred and fifty pounds. You can pay by direct debit on the first of each month. Great. Can we attend the induction session this Saturday at ten thirty in the morning? Yes, that is booked for you in Studio 2.",
